=== input-reads-numbers-and-text
--- sg
%a = <:
%b = <:
%c = <:
%d = <:
%e = <:
>: %a + 1
>: %b + 1
>: %c
>: %d + 1
>: %e + 1
--- in
41
1.5
abc
-3
+7
--- out
42
2.5
abc
-2
8

=== input-that-only-looks-numeric-stays-text
--- sg
%a = <:
%b = <:
>: %a + 1
>: %b + 1
--- in
1e5
1,5
--- out
1e51
1,51

=== input-text-is-kept-as-typed-numbers-ignore-surrounding-blanks
--- sg
%a = <:
%b = <:
>: '[' + %a + ']'
>: %b + 1
--- in
  hi  there
 12<TAB>
--- out
[  hi  there]
13

=== reprompt-until-a-number-with-isnum
--- sg
%n = <:
@!#isnum(%n):
    >: 'again'
    %n = <:
>: %n + 1
--- in
x

1,5
41
--- out
again
again
again
42

=== input-can-fill-a-list-element
--- sg
%l = [0, 0]
%l[1] = <:
>: %l
--- in
7
--- out
[0, 7]

=== coloured-output
--- sg
>:E2 'x'
>:I6 'green'
>:A7 'red'
--- out
<ESC>[38;5;143mx<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[38;5;76mgreen<ESC>[0m
<ESC>[38;5;166mred<ESC>[0m

=== coloured-output-takes-an-expression
--- sg
%n = 3
>:E2 'n = ' + %n
--- out
<ESC>[38;5;143mn = 3<ESC>[0m
